  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a kadhai over medium heat. Add chopped onion and sauté until translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger; sauté for another minute.",
    "Add sliced bell pepper and diced tomato; cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add black pudding, miso paste, soy sauce, chili flakes, cumin powder, and coriander powder.",
    "Stir well to combine and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Using a spatula, break the black pudding into jagged pieces and stir well.",
    "Continue cooking for another 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro if desired."
